WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.525
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.795 --> 00:15.995
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:16.065 --> 00:19.095
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:19.165 --> 00:22.365
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:23.435 --> 00:25.335
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.685 --> 00:40.085
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.155 --> 00:41.585
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.655 --> 00:43.095
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
00:45.795 --> 00:48.065
There are two kinds of men in this world.

10
00:48.425 --> 00:51.835
Men who need a bodyguard, and men who don't.

11
00:51.895 --> 00:53.235
(Han Jung Woo, Director at BS Group, Group Heir)

12
00:53.305 --> 00:54.505
(Under threat from his half-siblings)

13
00:55.505 --> 00:59.205
If a handsome, gentlemanly man loved by everyone...

14
00:59.275 --> 01:00.845
happens to be the heir to this conglomerate,

15
01:01.405 --> 01:03.045
it does not matter which kind he is.

16
01:03.815 --> 01:04.815
But...

17
01:06.945 --> 01:10.215
If he is under threat from half-siblings pushed aside,

18
01:11.055 --> 01:12.455
that changes everything.

19
01:12.515 --> 01:14.825
Hey, Han Jung Woo. Pull over. You better stop!

20
01:14.885 --> 01:16.125
Hey, I said pull over!

21
02:13.885 --> 02:14.885
Floor it!

22
02:21.685 --> 02:22.685
What's going on?

23
02:24.125 --> 02:25.495
- What is happening? - Open the door!

24
02:25.495 --> 02:26.525
- Grab him. - Darn it.

25
02:26.525 --> 02:27.565
Let's out!

26
02:42.045 --> 02:43.075
What?

27
02:46.585 --> 02:47.585
Who is that?

28
03:39.395 --> 03:40.665
(Cha Hong Du, Taekwondo Master, Part-Time Queen)

29
03:40.735 --> 03:42.505
(The toughest woman in the neighborhood)

30
03:43.505 --> 03:45.005
You were a woman?

31
03:45.075 --> 03:47.005
Of course, I am a woman.

32
03:47.405 --> 03:50.175
A bold, tough woman who can fight.

33
03:53.385 --> 03:55.385
I guess I don't need to work out today.

34
03:56.885 --> 03:58.655
Darn it. I'm going to be so late.

35
04:02.225 --> 04:03.225
Hey, wait.

36
04:05.025 --> 04:08.065
You can't just leave like that. At least tell me your name.

37
04:09.125 --> 04:10.135
Hong Du.

38
04:11.095 --> 04:12.095
Cha Hong Du.

39
04:13.765 --> 04:15.505
Cha Hong Du?

40
04:31.115 --> 04:34.555
That's how we met, like it was fate...

41
04:36.495 --> 04:38.255
I wish.

42
04:38.395 --> 04:41.065
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard" continues in episode two)

43
04:41.195 --> 04:44.435
That was the story of the heroine in that drama.

44
04:45.495 --> 04:46.965
And as for me,

45
04:47.035 --> 04:51.775
I am a drama nerd who has watched this show over a million times.

46
04:52.505 --> 04:54.675
And that man in particular...

47
04:55.175 --> 04:57.475
I am Um Tae Bong's biggest fan.

48
04:58.215 --> 05:01.115
Watching my favorite drama and losing myself in daydreams...

49
05:01.615 --> 05:03.315
is my greatest joy in life.

50
05:03.315 --> 05:04.985
You could call it living vicariously.

51
05:05.315 --> 05:08.325
Someone I want to be but never can.

52
05:09.695 --> 05:10.925
Because...

53
05:11.655 --> 05:14.525
Ms. Hae Ra, your meal is ready.

54
05:17.265 --> 05:21.205
Have you ever heard of anthropophobia?

55
05:21.835 --> 05:26.645
Ever since second grade, I have never once stepped outside.

56
05:27.445 --> 05:30.145
School? Not applicable.

57
05:31.075 --> 05:33.285
No friends either, you ask?

58
05:33.715 --> 05:35.285
That goes without saying.

59
05:35.885 --> 05:39.485
Still, I know what I need to know.

60
05:40.225 --> 05:44.595
I already know full well how scary the outside world is.

61
05:45.325 --> 05:49.195
Thanks to the news, I have got ethics and social studies down pat.

62
05:50.695 --> 05:52.135
A couple set of figurines.

63
05:52.195 --> 05:53.635
(Lovely couple pigs)

64
05:53.705 --> 05:55.605
One is mine.

65
05:57.105 --> 05:58.205
And the other one...

66
05:59.275 --> 06:00.345
See that?

67
06:00.405 --> 06:03.175
I am well-versed in spending and economics too.

68
06:03.245 --> 06:04.475
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard)

69
06:04.545 --> 06:05.775
Oh, physical training?

70
06:19.155 --> 06:21.795
If I were the heroine of that drama,

71
06:22.225 --> 06:24.295
I could protect him too.

72
06:24.895 --> 06:26.935
Ms. Hae Ra, what happened?

73
06:27.935 --> 06:30.505
I am sorry, Mr. Nam Goong.

74
06:32.435 --> 06:36.305
- It is all right. - I am a bit uncoordinated.

75
06:36.715 --> 06:37.745
But still, I...

76
06:37.815 --> 06:41.785
Napoleon rose from soldier to emperor,

77
06:41.845 --> 06:44.455
and he left us the famous words, "Nothing is impossible."

78
06:44.515 --> 06:45.815
Thanks to Mr. Nam Goong,

79
06:45.885 --> 06:49.795
- I am a very cultured recluse. - Miss,

80
06:51.695 --> 06:54.565
how about going outside with me today?

81
06:56.065 --> 06:57.095
Not yet.

82
06:57.635 --> 07:02.005
Yes, then whenever you want to walk out that door yourself...

83
07:06.845 --> 07:08.645
I ran into her in the living room earlier,

84
07:08.705 --> 07:10.475
and she just ran right away.

85
07:10.475 --> 07:12.615
She eats alone and plays alone.

86
07:12.675 --> 07:15.515
It is easier to just treat her like a ghost.

87
07:15.585 --> 07:18.415
A ghost? Oh my, how pitiful.

88
07:18.885 --> 07:20.785
But why does she eat separately?

89
07:20.855 --> 07:23.025
How would I know? Mind your own business.

90
07:23.455 --> 07:26.455
Why should we care about a daughter the Chairman ignores?

91
07:53.055 --> 07:56.555
Nobody likes me.

92
07:58.155 --> 08:00.495
What does it feel like...

93
08:01.525 --> 08:02.965
being loved by someone?

94
08:18.015 --> 08:20.785
I wish something would happen to me too.

95
08:21.315 --> 08:23.955
Suddenly, just like that rain.

96
08:41.535 --> 08:43.675
(Oh! My Guard)

97
08:45.475 --> 08:47.845
(Episode 1)

98
09:02.555 --> 09:04.155
Do not come closer. Stop right there.

99
09:04.225 --> 09:06.895
The two of them kiss. It is written in the script.

100
09:06.965 --> 09:09.395
Since when did you have such a passion for acting?

101
09:09.465 --> 09:10.495
You can't even act.

102
09:11.895 --> 09:12.995
Cut!

103
09:13.505 --> 09:14.605
What? Who just yelled cut?

104
09:14.865 --> 09:16.105
Was it me? Was it you?

105
09:17.535 --> 09:18.535
It was me.

106
09:18.805 --> 09:21.005
Oh, it was you, Tae Bong.

107
09:21.075 --> 09:23.515
But I am the director, and I did not yell cut.

108
09:23.515 --> 09:25.045
Man, it was going so well just now.

109
09:25.115 --> 09:29.115
Exactly. My emotions were perfect just now too.

110
09:29.485 --> 09:31.415
I thought you were different from the others, Director.

111
09:31.415 --> 09:32.485
What?

112
09:35.325 --> 09:37.095
I am completely crazy about this woman.

113
09:39.155 --> 09:40.695
My eyes were already doing all the work,

114
09:40.765 --> 09:43.365
and the viewers would be totally immersed with their hearts pounding.

115
09:43.435 --> 09:46.435
Then the minute-by-minute ratings would obviously hit their peak.

116
09:47.005 --> 09:48.005
And?

117
09:48.065 --> 09:51.575
And yet you insist on ending it with the leads locking lips,

118
09:51.635 --> 09:54.675
believing it is the only way to transmit love to viewers,

119
09:54.745 --> 09:58.615
the illogical and uncreative style of Korean dramas...

120
09:59.675 --> 10:02.745
You are not that kind of lousy director, are you?

121
10:03.585 --> 10:06.455
Oh, well, I am not on the lousy side. Gosh...

122
10:08.085 --> 10:11.355
No, but it is a romance, so if we leave out the kiss scene...

123
10:11.425 --> 10:14.465
The ratings will drop, and we will lose advertisements.

124
10:14.525 --> 10:16.465
- Exactly. - Want to make a bet?

125
10:17.695 --> 10:18.735
Darn it.

126
10:19.795 --> 10:21.735
Hey, this is the ending scene for episode eight.

127
10:21.735 --> 10:23.505
The ending of episode eight has to be a kiss.

128
10:23.575 --> 10:24.705
We've trained them to expect it,

129
10:24.775 --> 10:26.605
so how can we change the viewers overnight?

130
10:26.675 --> 10:30.075
I know you don't shoot kiss scenes. I know.

131
10:30.145 --> 10:32.345
But just this once, do it as a favor to me.

132
10:36.045 --> 10:38.715
Then, as a favor to you, Director...

133
10:40.255 --> 10:43.355
I will not shoot it. Absolutely no kiss scenes.

134
10:43.425 --> 10:44.525
(The Cocky Detective and Con Artist, Filming in progress)

135
10:44.595 --> 10:46.455
Why? Why on earth not?

136
10:46.525 --> 10:48.925
Why would you refuse to shoot something so good?

137
10:48.995 --> 10:50.695
- Because I don't want to. - Shoot it.

138
10:51.235 --> 10:53.365
- I will not. - Shoot it.

139
10:53.565 --> 10:56.065
- I absolutely will not. - Hey, Um Tae Bong!

140
10:59.235 --> 11:00.245
Just as I thought.

141
11:02.905 --> 11:04.045
You are lousy.

142
11:05.745 --> 11:07.545
"Lousy?" Hey, you punk!

143
11:08.045 --> 11:11.455
The word I hate the most is lousy! Seriously!

144
11:11.555 --> 11:12.715
Oh, darn it.

145
11:13.315 --> 11:15.585
Call the writer. Tell her I could not persuade that jerk.

146
11:15.655 --> 11:16.895
This is driving me crazy.

147
11:16.955 --> 11:21.195
I mean, what kind of romance master refuses to shoot kiss scenes?

148
11:21.265 --> 11:23.565
And who made him that romance master?

149
11:23.635 --> 11:25.595
I'm Pyo Jin Gosh!

150
11:25.665 --> 11:29.205
But he wants to attach a label like "does not shoot kiss scenes" to it?

151
11:29.265 --> 11:32.205
That is exactly why he is crazy.

152
11:32.275 --> 11:34.775
If he were next to me, I would have beaten him to death.

153
11:34.845 --> 11:36.475
This is already his third project with me.

154
11:36.545 --> 11:39.275
If he keeps refusing this time, I will make his character...

155
11:40.185 --> 11:41.915
into complete trash!

156
11:43.115 --> 11:45.185
I will be sure to pass that on to the trash.

157
11:51.725 --> 11:52.755
I passed it on.

158
11:55.065 --> 11:56.895
I heard you had a fight with the director too.

159
11:56.965 --> 11:58.735
Why did you talk down to the director?

160
11:58.795 --> 12:01.035
Should I drop my age next time?

161
12:02.065 --> 12:03.065
Or my forehead?

162
12:04.905 --> 12:06.335
Oh, I ought to just...

163
12:08.005 --> 12:10.845
A romantic comedy lead refusing to shoot a kiss scene.

164
12:11.845 --> 12:14.385
Where do I even begin to study this rare specimen?

165
12:14.445 --> 12:15.485
Do not study me.

166
12:15.545 --> 12:19.415
You have made a lot of money off this rare item so far, CEO Park.

167
12:19.485 --> 12:21.025
Are you in the mood for jokes right now?

168
12:21.085 --> 12:23.325
There is going to be another scandal now!

169
12:25.655 --> 12:26.655
Gosh.

170
12:28.365 --> 12:30.495
Oh, I need to hold it in.

171
12:30.565 --> 12:33.035
Should we have just revealed everything from the very beginning?

172
12:33.605 --> 12:34.635
No.

173
12:34.705 --> 12:37.205
If we did, would you have blown up like this out of nowhere?

174
12:38.005 --> 12:40.975
But you still have those romantic eyes,

175
12:41.045 --> 12:43.675
- so let us keep pushing forward. - What if we reveal it...

176
12:44.215 --> 12:45.215
even now?

177
12:46.275 --> 12:47.915
The reason why I don't shoot kiss scenes.

178
12:48.615 --> 12:51.455
You got famous from romance, and romance is where you sell best.

179
12:51.515 --> 12:54.325
Your life as a romance actor would be dead.

180
12:54.385 --> 12:55.555
And that is...

181
12:57.025 --> 12:58.895
a fatal flaw as a man, too.

182
13:00.495 --> 13:02.265
What are you looking at, punk? Darn you.

183
13:04.935 --> 13:05.965
What?

184
13:06.535 --> 13:07.535
A flaw?

185
13:10.035 --> 13:13.305
Let's set up a dating rumor first. It worked last time, too.

186
13:13.505 --> 13:15.345
You are the only one in Korea...

187
13:15.405 --> 13:16.545
whose dating rumors boost your popularity.

188
13:16.605 --> 13:20.315
Just stick with the sexy and decadent playboy image.

189
13:20.445 --> 13:22.185
A win-win strategy with women...

190
13:22.245 --> 13:23.985
who want to get famous through you, just like now.

191
13:25.055 --> 13:26.255
Tae Bong,

192
13:26.685 --> 13:27.885
you trust me, right?

193
13:27.925 --> 13:29.085
I will be the only one...

194
13:30.255 --> 13:32.125
who knows your secret until the day I die.

195
13:32.925 --> 13:34.225
Look hard for one.

196
13:36.165 --> 13:37.365
I am going to the interview.

197
13:37.435 --> 13:38.565
Oh, okay.

198
13:39.365 --> 13:40.365
Have a good time.

199
13:43.335 --> 13:45.005
(CEO Park Hwan Su)

200
13:46.805 --> 13:50.245
Where am I going to find a girl who is naive...

201
13:50.675 --> 13:52.615
but can keep a secret this time?

202
13:59.385 --> 14:00.785
- I'll do it. - Okay.

203
14:02.355 --> 14:03.695
Shall we begin?

204
14:04.095 --> 14:05.195
Yes.

205
14:05.555 --> 14:08.565
After the unprecedented hit "The Crown Prince's Bodyguard,"

206
14:08.625 --> 14:10.335
this is your first reunion in three years.

207
14:10.395 --> 14:12.835
Will we not be seeing a kiss scene in this project either?

208
14:13.465 --> 14:16.105
There are rumors that there is a real reason behind it.

209
14:16.165 --> 14:19.705
I am sure you know that I am not into men.

210
14:20.445 --> 14:23.505
Honestly, my skills are too breathtaking to show publicly,

211
14:23.575 --> 14:25.115
so I think the broadcasting committee would censor it.

212
14:25.175 --> 14:26.175
Well,

213
14:31.915 --> 14:35.055
I can prove it to you privately as much as you want.

214
14:40.965 --> 14:43.265
I suppose differentiating yourself from other romance actors...

215
14:43.325 --> 14:44.565
is a good strategy.

216
14:46.195 --> 14:47.805
Assuming you are not deceiving your fans...

217
14:47.865 --> 14:49.405
for some other reason.

218
14:53.235 --> 14:54.775
Are you not going to ask our leading lady any questions?

219
14:54.845 --> 14:56.875
As for Na Ri...

220
15:02.645 --> 15:05.555
Right. How do you take care of your skin, Na Ri?

221
15:05.615 --> 15:06.915
Excuse me? I don't do anything special...

222
15:06.985 --> 15:09.355
To act while also promoting with your girl group,

223
15:09.425 --> 15:10.425
what is the secret to your figure?

224
15:10.495 --> 15:11.795
Do you have a special routine?

225
15:13.225 --> 15:15.625
I just eat well and move around a lot...

226
15:15.725 --> 15:16.725
I see.

227
15:19.165 --> 15:20.165
Actor Um,

228
15:20.235 --> 15:22.235
people say your acting range has broadened.

229
15:22.305 --> 15:24.375
What did you focus on the most while acting?

230
15:24.775 --> 15:25.775
My pores.

231
15:25.835 --> 15:27.745
(The Cocky Detective and Con Artist)

232
15:27.805 --> 15:30.275
Male actors care a lot about their skin too,

233
15:30.775 --> 15:32.545
since TV resolution is incredible these days.

234
15:33.175 --> 15:35.715
But this friend here is different from me.

235
15:36.045 --> 15:39.585
On set, Song Na Ri's nickname is "Tattered."

236
15:40.385 --> 15:42.755
How do you get your script so tattered?

237
15:44.025 --> 15:45.695
Well, it is not that bad.

238
15:46.095 --> 15:47.265
Oh, you should tell her about that too.

239
15:47.325 --> 15:49.465
You are learning boxing these days.

240
15:50.565 --> 15:52.795
You said you really want to use your fists,

241
15:53.165 --> 15:54.835
but don't just swing them anywhere.

242
15:58.205 --> 16:02.775
I am going to take a break first. My skin needs some moisturizing.

243
16:02.845 --> 16:03.845
Good work.

244
16:06.915 --> 16:08.085
What is up with him?

245
16:08.145 --> 16:09.485
They say he gets sensitive when he has a shoot.

246
16:16.485 --> 16:17.825
I'm just grabbing some water.

247
16:18.095 --> 16:19.095
Oh my.

248
16:21.165 --> 16:23.995
Through this project, what have you learned as an actress?

249
16:30.675 --> 16:32.235
Hey...

250
16:32.305 --> 16:34.205
- Thank you for earlier. - For what?

251
16:35.145 --> 16:37.215
I was helping myself earlier, not you.

252
16:37.275 --> 16:38.275
The questions were so cliché...

253
16:38.345 --> 16:39.975
that I was just looking for a time to escape.

254
16:40.045 --> 16:42.245
That kind of dullness is an enemy to the skin.

255
16:48.985 --> 16:50.795
Right.

256
16:50.855 --> 16:52.655
It is the truth.

257
16:52.725 --> 16:54.895
Your script being tattered.

258
16:54.965 --> 16:58.495
Keep making it tattered like that. But...

259
17:01.165 --> 17:04.805
don't ever let your heart get tattered.

260
17:15.885 --> 17:16.985
Gosh, it is cold.

261
17:19.315 --> 17:21.955
Hey, wasn't Tae Bong's acting amazing earlier?

262
17:22.025 --> 17:23.425
Pretending to take Song Na Ri's side...

263
17:23.485 --> 17:25.295
while putting the reporter in her place.

264
17:25.355 --> 17:27.895
Song Na Ri seemed completely touched by it.

265
17:27.965 --> 17:28.995
I wasn't acting.

266
17:29.765 --> 17:30.765
Then what was it?

267
17:32.235 --> 17:34.735
Still, I guess I killed two birds with one stone.

268
17:35.305 --> 17:36.435
Call CEO Park.

269
17:37.035 --> 17:38.775
Tell him to call Song Na Ri's agency.

270
17:49.215 --> 17:51.385
Why? Did that jerk say something to you again?

271
17:54.425 --> 17:55.625
From now on,

272
17:56.655 --> 17:58.695
I think my heart is going to be tattered.

273
18:07.865 --> 18:09.105
Tae Bong, your smile faded again.

274
18:09.165 --> 18:10.335
Yes, ten dollars.

275
18:10.905 --> 18:12.575
Are you just looking at me instead of driving?

276
18:13.205 --> 18:15.075
You were the one who said that every time you frowned,

277
18:15.175 --> 18:16.775
- I should fine you. - I swear!

278
18:17.515 --> 18:18.615
Should I buy you a megaphone?

279
18:20.445 --> 18:22.985
But during the interview, Yangsu-dong,

280
18:23.715 --> 18:25.085
you secretly took pictures of me, didn't you?

281
18:28.955 --> 18:30.225
Even as a guy,

282
18:30.925 --> 18:31.995
does my face make your heart flutter?

283
18:34.565 --> 18:36.265
Do it one more time.

284
18:36.325 --> 18:38.995
I will report you for taking photos without permission. Got it?

285
18:39.635 --> 18:40.765
- Yes. - Oh, right.

286
18:41.305 --> 18:42.865
The black hoodie you wore for your airport fashion,

287
18:42.935 --> 18:44.535
the one with the skull embroidery on the hood.

288
18:44.605 --> 18:45.775
Did you send it to the dry cleaners?

289
18:45.835 --> 18:46.835
No.

290
18:47.445 --> 18:49.045
What about the blue jacket we got sponsored last time?

291
18:49.105 --> 18:50.105
Not that either.

292
18:51.475 --> 18:52.745
Where did they all go?

293
19:03.555 --> 19:06.825
Um Tae Bong, you crazy lunatic. He acts so high and mighty,

294
19:06.895 --> 19:08.225
but he has absolutely no intuition.

295
19:08.225 --> 19:10.125
Who would secretly photograph him because he looks cool?

296
19:11.835 --> 19:15.265
I need proof photos so I can sell them.

297
19:15.335 --> 19:17.135
No negotiations allowed.

298
19:17.175 --> 19:18.505
(Hot Celeb Shop)

299
19:19.305 --> 19:20.435
(New item of Um Tae Bong has been posted)

300
19:23.145 --> 19:24.675
(Price: 300 dollars, Buy Now)

301
19:27.615 --> 19:29.045
(Sold)

302
19:33.115 --> 19:34.585
What? It's already sold.

303
19:34.655 --> 19:36.255
- Ghost again? - They are a true ghost.

304
19:36.325 --> 19:39.125
- Wow, that was gone in a flash. - Please cancel the payment.

305
19:39.195 --> 19:41.265
I missed it again? Is this for real?

306
19:43.225 --> 19:44.995
Gosh, I am full.

307
19:45.935 --> 19:47.735
You're fine with just tteokbokki?

308
19:47.805 --> 19:50.165
- Even though you saved me. - Yes, it is plenty.

309
19:50.675 --> 19:52.205
I used to eat it every day,

310
19:52.275 --> 19:54.275
but I stopped after my stepmother abandoned me...

311
19:54.345 --> 19:55.375
to save money.

312
20:05.085 --> 20:06.085
Who is that guy?

313
20:06.155 --> 20:08.925
(Tteokbokki God)

314
20:12.325 --> 20:14.195
I didn't expect them to follow me all the way here.

315
20:14.265 --> 20:15.265
Someone is...

316
20:15.925 --> 20:17.095
trying to kill me.

317
20:17.735 --> 20:18.865
- Who? - Who?

318
20:18.935 --> 20:19.965
- Why? - Why?

319
20:20.465 --> 20:21.935
The people closest to me.

320
20:22.035 --> 20:23.365
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard)

321
20:23.435 --> 20:24.575
That is why I...

322
20:25.735 --> 20:26.875
don't trust anyone.

323
20:26.935 --> 20:28.605
- Then you don't trust me either? - Then you don't trust me either?

324
20:29.575 --> 20:31.045
- I could be a killer... - I could be a killer...

325
20:31.115 --> 20:32.575
- hired to kill you, too. - hired to kill you, too.

326
20:33.415 --> 20:35.315
No. I trust you.

327
20:36.015 --> 20:37.015
- You trust me? - You trust me?

328
20:37.355 --> 20:39.555
I trust you, Cha Hong Du.

329
20:40.785 --> 20:42.485
I don't know why, but somehow...

330
20:43.225 --> 20:44.455
I feel like you'd protect me.

331
20:52.495 --> 20:55.505
Miss, I'll leave your package by the door.

332
20:55.935 --> 20:59.705
Also, I've increased your credit card limit.

333
21:01.045 --> 21:03.075
Thank you, Mr. Nam Goong.

334
21:37.145 --> 21:38.215
Thank you.

335
21:47.485 --> 21:48.585
Oh, right.

336
21:49.185 --> 21:51.895
About that hoodie. It's a super rare limited edition,

337
21:51.955 --> 21:53.555
and I only got to wear it once.

338
21:53.555 --> 21:56.765
You have to find it.

339
21:57.095 --> 21:58.565
- Should we report it? - Hey!

340
21:59.295 --> 22:01.835
Last time he lost a sock, you reported it right away...

341
22:01.905 --> 22:03.505
and threw a massive fit, saying it was a stalker.

342
22:03.535 --> 22:04.575
And where did you find it?

343
22:04.575 --> 22:06.975
Stuck right under the car seat you were sitting on.

344
22:07.035 --> 22:08.505
If we report it and it turns up again?

345
22:08.575 --> 22:11.015
Then he'll look like a total psycho.

346
22:11.075 --> 22:13.315
- A psycho... - I'll make sure to find it.

347
22:14.845 --> 22:16.445
Yes, whatever.

348
22:18.055 --> 22:19.085
Oh, right.

349
22:19.455 --> 22:21.325
What should we do with the gifts from your fans?

350
22:22.425 --> 22:24.695
- Take them to my house. - Yes, sir. To your house, sir.

351
22:26.695 --> 22:27.695
Have a good one.

352
22:31.765 --> 22:33.265
(Celebrity Item Exchange)

353
22:33.865 --> 22:36.305
(A transaction of 1,000 dollars has been deposited)

354
23:07.735 --> 23:08.735
I trust you.

355
23:10.065 --> 23:11.605
I don't know why,

356
23:13.205 --> 23:14.945
but somehow I feel like you'd protect me.

357
23:20.575 --> 23:22.145
I hope wearing this...

358
23:22.215 --> 23:24.085
makes me truly strong.

359
23:28.185 --> 23:31.095
Just like the Iron Man suit.

360
23:35.165 --> 23:37.225
- Yes, hello. - I think that's him.

361
23:37.425 --> 23:38.735
Wow, he's so handsome.

362
23:38.795 --> 23:40.395
- He looks better in person. - His face is so small.

363
23:40.465 --> 23:41.465
He's really handsome.

364
23:43.165 --> 23:44.405
He must be here to eat.

365
23:45.075 --> 23:46.105
Did you give up on acting?

366
23:46.175 --> 23:48.675
- Aren't you counting calories? - You're the one who gave up.

367
23:49.075 --> 23:50.775
Why is a personal trainer making ramen here?

368
23:50.845 --> 23:52.075
You little punk.

369
23:52.545 --> 23:54.945
- Oh my, is he hitting him? - Is Um Tae Bong getting beaten up?

370
23:55.485 --> 23:56.515
No way.

371
23:56.515 --> 23:57.715
(We Have Noodles)

372
23:58.655 --> 24:01.555
- We have an audience, buddy. - Cut the crap, buddy.

373
24:03.225 --> 24:04.525
Eat up.

374
24:04.595 --> 24:06.155
- They must be friends. - I guess not.

375
24:13.635 --> 24:15.035
How long are you going to stay here?

376
24:15.905 --> 24:17.535
Has CEO Park still not found you a trainer?

377
24:18.005 --> 24:20.505
That old gym. I bought it last week.

378
24:21.705 --> 24:24.675
So take charge of my body again. My body...

379
24:25.945 --> 24:27.345
only remembers you.

380
24:28.415 --> 24:30.215
What? His body remembers him...

381
24:30.545 --> 24:32.715
- Oh my gosh. - Crazy bastard.

382
24:35.855 --> 24:37.855
Why? There's only one bite left.

383
24:40.425 --> 24:41.965
Actually,

384
24:42.025 --> 24:45.935
those beautiful fans over there have been staring at me.

385
24:50.975 --> 24:52.105
Those people...

386
24:53.405 --> 24:54.475
are here to see me.

387
24:59.075 --> 25:01.015
- Are you on drugs? - You should take some.

388
25:01.145 --> 25:02.545
This guy, seriously.

389
25:02.615 --> 25:03.815
Sit down.

390
25:05.515 --> 25:06.755
(We Have Noodles)

391
25:06.815 --> 25:07.855
Do you want to fight?

392
25:08.425 --> 25:10.655
- Take off your armor, you punk. - Gosh, you are no fun.

393
25:31.015 --> 25:32.615
- I am leaving. - Already?

394
25:33.075 --> 25:34.115
Yes.

395
25:35.045 --> 25:36.215
Anyway,

396
25:36.845 --> 25:39.385
- think carefully about my offer. - Gosh.

397
25:50.365 --> 25:51.465
Look at this, look at this.

398
25:51.795 --> 25:54.765
Oh, seriously. Be careful.

399
25:55.435 --> 25:56.565
What should we eat?

400
25:56.635 --> 25:57.675
Should we just have chicken?

401
25:57.735 --> 26:01.875
I like peppermint candy the best. Right after our Hyun Joo.

402
26:04.375 --> 26:07.015
Oh, what is that? That is so cheesy. Give me one too.

403
26:07.075 --> 26:08.415
Really? Here, eat it.

404
26:09.945 --> 26:12.255
- Oh, seriously. - Hey, they sell hats.

405
26:13.355 --> 26:14.485
It is pretty.

406
26:20.825 --> 26:24.565
My grandmother almost died. The man who loved her...

407
26:24.635 --> 26:27.335
put that ring on her finger and proposed,

408
26:27.395 --> 26:29.105
and she came back to life.

409
26:29.765 --> 26:31.805
Of course, she was a bit strange after waking up.

410
26:33.005 --> 26:34.375
What is this, the One Ring?

411
26:36.045 --> 26:38.075
This foreigner is lying his mouth off in Korean.

412
26:38.145 --> 26:41.345
It's 30 dollars. It is really cheap. It is a steal.

413
27:04.535 --> 27:05.675
(Outstanding Employee Award)

414
27:11.445 --> 27:14.615
There you go again. Did I not tell you to always smile?

415
27:20.055 --> 27:21.055
Happy?

416
27:22.755 --> 27:25.355
Tae Bong. I am leaving the fan gifts here.

417
27:29.625 --> 27:30.965
Oh, boy.

418
28:01.295 --> 28:02.865
(Tae Bong, I hope you are miserable for the rest of your life.)

419
28:08.305 --> 28:09.305
You again?

420
28:10.905 --> 28:13.075
You knew your direct messages would be blocked,

421
28:13.935 --> 28:16.205
so you are going to keep sending fan letters?

422
28:17.575 --> 28:20.175
But does a hater really need to be this diligent?

423
28:36.725 --> 28:38.165
You...

424
28:38.235 --> 28:40.035
didn't come with that, did you?

425
28:40.435 --> 28:42.235
Are you sure you two are not on the same team?

426
28:45.035 --> 28:46.205
You ugly thing.

427
28:59.255 --> 29:02.055
("'Romance Master' Um Tae Bong Refuses Kiss Scenes")

428
29:02.055 --> 29:03.825
(Only mysterious excuses?)

429
29:06.795 --> 29:08.495
(Sports Daehan Reporter Yeo Mi Ran)

430
29:11.465 --> 29:14.295
Even without kiss scenes, my heart is already on fire!

431
29:14.365 --> 29:16.835
Is he avoiding kiss scenes because of bad breath?

432
29:16.905 --> 29:18.305
Do not pay attention to them.

433
29:18.375 --> 29:20.875
We, Um's Little Darlings, will protect you.

434
29:20.935 --> 29:23.745
Wait, maybe Um Tae Bong has never even kissed anyone?

435
29:23.805 --> 29:26.445
What? "Never even kissed anyone?"

436
29:26.515 --> 29:27.645
How do you know?

437
29:27.715 --> 29:30.685
How do you know if I've never kissed anyone or not?

438
29:48.405 --> 29:49.835
Tae Bong.

439
29:51.105 --> 29:52.105
Let's head out.

440
29:56.275 --> 29:57.775
It is time to shoot scene 13 today.

441
29:57.845 --> 29:59.245
They said they are going to start shooting right now.

442
30:07.785 --> 30:09.285
Were we supposed to shoot here today?

443
30:09.355 --> 30:10.355
Yes, over there.

444
30:10.425 --> 30:12.295
He is so handsome, wow, freaking handsome.

445
30:13.595 --> 30:15.095
Look over here.

446
30:15.695 --> 30:16.995
This neighborhood hasn't changed...

447
30:17.065 --> 30:18.835
- He is so handsome. - one bit.

448
30:21.135 --> 30:22.135
Shall we go?

449
30:29.075 --> 30:30.605
Excuse me, coming through. I am sorry.

450
30:32.045 --> 30:34.175
I really want to see Um Tae Bong too.

451
30:34.245 --> 30:35.485
We have a lot of work to do, miss.

452
30:35.545 --> 30:37.615
Ma'am. They say Um Tae Bong is outside.

453
30:37.685 --> 30:40.085
What? Really? Is he handsome?

454
30:40.155 --> 30:42.585
The alley is especially noisy today.

455
30:42.655 --> 30:44.255
You know about it too, Manager Nam Goong.

456
30:44.325 --> 30:46.495
They are filming a drama right out front,

457
30:46.555 --> 30:48.765
and they say he is here. You know, Um Tae Bong.

458
30:49.595 --> 30:51.025
Yes, I saw him too.

459
30:51.395 --> 30:52.865
Gosh, but that guy...

460
30:52.935 --> 30:55.005
looked like he got seriously injured during filming.

461
30:55.335 --> 30:56.905
What? No...

462
30:56.965 --> 30:58.535
Where and how badly?

463
30:59.405 --> 31:01.275
Well, I only caught a glimpse...

464
31:01.345 --> 31:03.905
Anyway, the situation did not look good.

465
31:03.975 --> 31:06.645
- Oh no. - I hope he is not hurt too badly.

466
31:06.715 --> 31:08.085
No, it sounds like a major accident.

467
31:08.145 --> 31:09.145
No, what is...

468
31:46.915 --> 31:48.955
Oh my.

469
31:49.885 --> 31:51.695
Um Tae Bong, that guy,

470
31:51.755 --> 31:53.925
if he really suffered a major injury...

471
31:53.995 --> 31:55.095
- What do we do... - Gosh.

472
31:56.395 --> 31:57.665
No, what is going on?

473
32:12.345 --> 32:13.375
I...

474
32:14.645 --> 32:15.715
feel like...

475
32:19.015 --> 32:21.055
something's wrong...

476
32:29.225 --> 32:30.925
- Oh, what do we do? - He collapsed.

477
32:30.995 --> 32:33.235
- Is he hurt? - Tae Bong!

478
32:35.635 --> 32:36.935
(Umtaebong)

479
32:41.545 --> 32:43.005
("Um Tae Bong, Major Injury During Filming")

480
32:49.445 --> 32:52.355
(Actor Um Tae Bong was covered in blood. After the accident...)

481
33:04.195 --> 33:05.965
Darn it...

482
33:06.035 --> 33:07.535
Am I really...

483
33:08.135 --> 33:09.935
going to end like this?

484
33:29.855 --> 33:31.125
Are you listening?

485
33:31.795 --> 33:33.495
If you are listening from somewhere,

486
33:34.525 --> 33:35.795
come quickly.

487
34:25.245 --> 34:26.745
Hurry...

488
34:26.815 --> 34:28.085
Hurry and run...

489
34:29.585 --> 34:31.215
If not now, we...

490
34:32.155 --> 34:33.355
will never...

491
34:34.185 --> 34:35.555
meet.

492
34:43.165 --> 34:44.595
Ms. Hae Ra...

493
34:44.695 --> 34:47.565
- Is she going outside? - I think she is going out...

494
35:03.345 --> 35:04.915
Just a little more.

495
35:04.985 --> 35:05.985
Hurry.

496
35:24.305 --> 35:25.535
Hurry and run.

497
35:26.275 --> 35:27.335
Hurry.

498
35:31.275 --> 35:32.575
I can do this.

499
35:34.045 --> 35:35.545
If not this time,

500
35:37.315 --> 35:40.815
I might never see him again.

501
35:42.985 --> 35:44.925
Please come quickly, hurry.

502
35:46.055 --> 35:47.925
Cut, okay.

503
35:47.995 --> 35:48.995
Gosh.

504
35:50.565 --> 35:51.695
Why is he running in there?

505
35:51.765 --> 35:54.595
Why are you overreacting and coming in before the cut sign?

506
35:54.665 --> 35:56.405
Seriously, you...

507
35:56.465 --> 35:57.535
Why?

508
35:58.105 --> 36:00.635
Was my acting that realistic?

509
36:01.275 --> 36:04.205
If I don't react like this, you will nag me forever.

510
36:04.645 --> 36:07.415
I am the one who has to act, me. Hey.

511
36:08.785 --> 36:10.685
Director,

512
36:10.745 --> 36:12.815
I don't think this take was okay either.

513
36:12.885 --> 36:13.955
Let's go one more time.

514
36:15.025 --> 36:17.725
No, no, no. What is wrong with him?

515
36:17.785 --> 36:20.595
No, this one was killer.

516
36:20.655 --> 36:23.395
Even Christopher Nolan would be blown away.

517
36:23.465 --> 36:24.895
I think my lines got a bit twisted.

518
36:24.965 --> 36:27.035
When I got hit by the wooden sword, instead of "Ack,"

519
36:29.065 --> 36:30.235
I think I went "Gosh."

520
36:30.305 --> 36:34.075
Oh, what are you talking about? I clearly heard... It wasn't "Gosh."

521
36:34.135 --> 36:36.475
- It was "Ack." Yes. - Right, "Ack."

522
36:36.805 --> 36:39.675
Please, let's move to next location.

523
36:39.875 --> 36:42.485
Didn't you say to take out that splinter?

524
36:42.485 --> 36:44.245
- Move to next place. - Moving, moving.

525
36:44.245 --> 36:45.915
- Hurry up. - It's true, you totally killed it.

526
36:45.985 --> 36:47.685
- Moving. - You killed everyone here.

527
36:47.755 --> 36:48.985
Pack it up!

528
36:48.985 --> 36:50.985
Great work, everyone. Great work.

529
36:52.295 --> 36:53.295
Gosh, still...

530
36:59.295 --> 37:00.635
You already did it all earlier.

531
37:01.295 --> 37:03.435
I get it. Wow, I was really moved too...

532
37:03.435 --> 37:04.465
Don't eat it.

533
37:04.465 --> 37:07.505
On that note, get some coffee from the cafe over there.

534
37:08.775 --> 37:10.575
What, all the way over there? It's too far...

535
37:10.645 --> 37:12.615
I know it's far. That's why I'm telling you to go there.

536
37:12.675 --> 37:14.845
I'll be over there getting my injury treated,

537
37:15.615 --> 37:16.615
so hurry back.

538
37:16.685 --> 37:19.855
Seriously, calling an ambulance over a single splinter in your finger.

539
37:19.915 --> 37:21.925
Gosh, how am I supposed to walk in this weather?

540
37:21.985 --> 37:23.085
Who said to walk?

541
37:23.525 --> 37:25.325
Run! Run.

542
37:25.325 --> 37:27.025
Dolce cold brew latte, no ice.

543
37:28.695 --> 37:30.565
- Seon Mi, let's go. - Want to monitor the footage?

544
37:30.625 --> 37:31.665
Yes, turn it on.

545
37:32.135 --> 37:34.565
("Um Tae Bong, Major Injury During Filming")

546
37:34.565 --> 37:37.235
(Actor Um Tae Bong was covered in blood. After the accident...)

547
37:43.245 --> 37:45.515
Gosh, who wrote this?

548
37:45.575 --> 37:47.645
Man, they're exaggerating as much as I do.

549
37:47.715 --> 37:49.515
The reporter who came to the set earlier.

550
37:49.585 --> 37:52.315
They left after seeing you make a huge fuss about dying of pain.

551
37:52.385 --> 37:54.685
No, the ambulance was on standby for shooting the action scene.

552
37:54.755 --> 37:56.785
I didn't actually call it for a splinter.

553
37:57.655 --> 37:59.595
I'll go return the stunt double's costume.

554
38:01.255 --> 38:02.265
You...

555
38:03.395 --> 38:04.665
- Is he hurt? - Is he inside?

556
38:04.725 --> 38:05.735
He shouldn't be hurt.

557
38:19.945 --> 38:21.475
- Isn't that him? - Isn't he hurt?

558
38:21.545 --> 38:22.545
- Are you filming? - Yes.

559
38:24.015 --> 38:25.015
Awesome.

560
38:28.055 --> 38:30.025
Tae Bong is in the ambulance right now, CEO Park.

561
38:31.455 --> 38:32.725
Excuse me.

562
38:32.995 --> 38:34.795
- What is it? - What is it?

563
38:35.695 --> 38:37.525
Yes. It's nothing. All right.

564
38:39.635 --> 38:40.635
Oh no.

565
38:43.265 --> 38:44.265
I hope it's nothing...

566
39:10.295 --> 39:11.495
Hey, that's...

567
39:18.035 --> 39:19.575
That's definitely my hoodie.

568
39:21.335 --> 39:22.345
Who are you?

569
39:30.245 --> 39:31.245
I got you.

570
39:32.755 --> 39:33.755
What?

571
39:35.055 --> 39:36.055
Who are you?

572
39:37.225 --> 39:39.925
I'm asking you. What are you doing here right now?

573
39:40.255 --> 39:41.825
This voice...

574
39:41.895 --> 39:44.665
is the real Um Tae Bong?

575
39:46.365 --> 39:47.535
Oh, the skull embroidery.

576
39:48.295 --> 39:51.335
Oh, even the ramyeon broth stain. This is undeniably mine.

577
39:51.775 --> 39:52.875
How do you have this?

578
39:54.475 --> 39:57.205
Whatever. What's your deal?

579
39:57.645 --> 40:01.145
I'm someone who really, really likes you...

580
40:01.215 --> 40:02.845
- A thief? - I'm a thief.

581
40:02.915 --> 40:03.915
What?

582
40:05.085 --> 40:07.715
I was wondering why things kept disappearing lately.

583
40:07.785 --> 40:11.685
Gosh, it was a Robin Hood in a hoodie.

584
40:11.755 --> 40:14.025
You sneaked in like this before and stole everything.

585
40:14.025 --> 40:16.425
Gosh, I am really not a thief.

586
40:16.625 --> 40:19.095
I really just came to see you,

587
40:19.165 --> 40:21.065
and I stepped out of the house for the first time in 20 years...

588
40:21.135 --> 40:22.135
Robin Hood.

589
40:23.235 --> 40:25.275
Do you think I will let you off if you look at me like that?

590
40:25.475 --> 40:27.635
Celebrities must show mercy to haters, stalkers, and thieves,

591
40:27.705 --> 40:29.645
no matter what, just to look like good people.

592
40:30.805 --> 40:33.475
But what can I do? I am not that kind of person.

593
40:33.815 --> 40:35.685
What do you even look like?

594
40:36.115 --> 40:37.115
Take that off.

595
40:38.885 --> 40:41.085
Oh, you are running away?

596
40:42.425 --> 40:43.425
Take it off.

597
40:44.455 --> 40:45.455
You won't?

598
40:46.825 --> 40:49.525
Fine, then I will take it off for you.

599
40:50.365 --> 40:53.765
I bought coffee. Stop whining and just...

600
40:58.005 --> 41:00.205
Where did she go? You...

601
41:00.405 --> 41:01.905
We'll be late for the flight.

602
41:01.975 --> 41:02.975
Darn it...

603
41:55.965 --> 41:56.965
No.

604
43:21.985 --> 43:26.015
(Two Weeks Later)

605
43:28.215 --> 43:29.285
It is Um Tae Bong!

606
43:31.155 --> 43:32.855
Do you know rumors broke out...

607
43:32.855 --> 43:34.155
while filming overseas for two weeks?

608
43:34.225 --> 43:36.395
Are you confirming your relationship with Song Na Ri?

609
43:36.465 --> 43:39.465
You are not coming in together? You two must have already fought.

610
43:41.095 --> 43:43.065
We are together today, but tomorrow...

611
43:44.105 --> 43:45.265
Who knows.

612
43:45.335 --> 43:46.875
Yes, excuse us. Coming through. Careful.

613
43:46.935 --> 43:48.805
- Excuse me! - Coming through.

614
43:52.345 --> 43:54.645
She has no obvious physical injuries...

615
43:54.715 --> 43:55.985
and is breathing on her own,

616
43:55.985 --> 43:57.185
but she's in a persistent vegetative state.

617
43:57.845 --> 43:59.485
If she continues in this condition,

618
43:59.485 --> 44:02.855
you may need to prepare for the worst...

619
44:03.625 --> 44:04.955
I am sorry, sir.

620
44:07.555 --> 44:08.555
Please give us a moment.

621
44:18.805 --> 44:20.635
Why do you think she is not waking up?

622
44:22.445 --> 44:24.975
Other than her mother, no one ever hugged her.

623
44:26.145 --> 44:28.445
She was fearful, timid, and even had social anxiety.

624
44:29.745 --> 44:32.315
She lived like a ghost for so long,

625
44:34.255 --> 44:36.485
and now she is rebelling against me like this?

626
44:37.855 --> 44:38.855
Chairman Oh.

627
44:44.295 --> 44:46.135
What did this child like the most?

628
44:48.035 --> 44:49.605
Show her as much of that as possible.

629
44:56.005 --> 44:57.575
The shareholders' movements are not looking good.

630
44:58.675 --> 45:01.475
They will likely propose my dismissal at the general meeting,

631
45:02.285 --> 45:03.885
so to defend our management rights,

632
45:05.515 --> 45:07.555
word about her condition must not leak out.

633
45:08.885 --> 45:09.885
Understood.

634
45:19.635 --> 45:22.405
Why did she suddenly go out?

635
45:25.505 --> 45:26.905
If only she had not done that...

636
45:35.785 --> 45:38.685
(Juan Hospital)

637
45:49.295 --> 45:52.635
I would like to gift our young lady a special time for her birthday.

638
45:52.695 --> 45:53.995
(CEO Park Hwan Su)

639
45:54.995 --> 45:59.205
Well, a fan meeting for just one person is...

640
45:59.275 --> 46:01.005
a bit difficult to price...

641
46:05.205 --> 46:08.545
What? A blank check?

642
46:08.915 --> 46:10.945
But there is a condition.

643
46:11.685 --> 46:13.755
The patient's details must remain strictly confidential.

644
46:14.355 --> 46:15.415
Gosh, no.

645
46:15.555 --> 46:17.685
You could've just called. Why do you keep making me come and go?

646
46:18.085 --> 46:19.395
Do you want me to say it again?

647
46:19.455 --> 46:22.695
- No. - Why do you hate the idea so much?

648
46:23.165 --> 46:24.995
Have you ever even seen one? A blank check?

649
46:25.065 --> 46:27.065
That is why I said no.

650
46:27.065 --> 46:29.165
Who are they to give me a blank check?

651
46:29.235 --> 46:31.165
Well, they have a lot of money.

652
46:31.635 --> 46:33.635
- Anyway, you have to do it. - No.

653
46:33.905 --> 46:36.505
I can't stand people who think money can buy anything.

654
46:36.575 --> 46:39.145
I am never doing a fan meeting like that.

655
46:48.755 --> 46:50.885
Actually, that woman...

656
46:52.195 --> 46:53.195
is sick.

657
46:54.355 --> 46:55.765
They said it was top secret.

658
46:57.795 --> 46:59.535
But I figured I should let you know.

659
47:01.095 --> 47:02.095
She is sick?

660
47:03.905 --> 47:04.905
She is sick.

661
47:06.205 --> 47:07.305
Very sick, at that.

662
47:12.375 --> 47:13.445
Hey.

663
47:17.685 --> 47:18.685
Yes.

664
47:19.655 --> 47:21.055
Should I schedule the fan meeting?

665
47:26.555 --> 47:28.455
Do not ever act in front of me again.

666
47:28.595 --> 47:30.165
Are you a goldfish? A birdbrain?

667
47:30.825 --> 47:32.295
How could you forget so quickly...

668
47:32.895 --> 47:36.005
Did you think I would just jump at the chance to do the fan meeting?

669
47:36.065 --> 47:37.065
No, she is really sick...

670
47:37.135 --> 47:39.735
This makes me really, really not want to do it even more.

671
47:39.805 --> 47:42.505
Do not set me up with people who throw money around anymore.

672
47:42.505 --> 47:43.605
And...

673
47:43.875 --> 47:45.245
Stop with the terrible acting.

674
47:45.575 --> 47:46.715
"She is sick."

675
47:47.215 --> 47:48.775
What was that?

676
47:52.585 --> 47:53.915
Gosh, darn it.

677
47:57.955 --> 48:00.155
Yes. I understand.

678
48:14.775 --> 48:17.145
It seems he and you are not meant to be.

679
48:18.345 --> 48:19.975
But you must wake up.

680
48:21.345 --> 48:23.415
You are the only heiress to BK.

681
48:24.845 --> 48:26.055
And what happened back then...

682
48:28.315 --> 48:30.655
You are a strong person who has endured so much until now.

683
48:34.195 --> 48:35.995
Is Na Ri still in Hong Kong?

684
48:36.065 --> 48:38.295
Did she say she was doing a girl group performance too?

685
48:39.065 --> 48:40.535
You must miss your girlfriend.

686
48:40.795 --> 48:41.795
Hold on.

687
48:57.545 --> 49:01.155
Tae Bong, I'm at the Hong Kong airport right now.

688
49:01.215 --> 49:03.355
I am stuck here because of bad weather.

689
49:03.885 --> 49:06.125
I think I am going to miss the drama shoot.

690
49:06.495 --> 49:08.625
Can you make them skip one week of broadcasting?

691
49:12.365 --> 49:14.795
Why? What is it?

692
49:14.865 --> 49:16.705
I'm hearing things.

693
49:17.465 --> 49:19.805
I think I messed with the wrong person this time.

694
49:19.875 --> 49:21.935
Why? What is going on?

695
49:24.075 --> 49:25.075
What?

696
49:29.285 --> 49:32.315
Oh my, it really is yours.

697
49:32.315 --> 49:35.115
I really bought this on a celebrity memorabilia trading site.

698
49:35.315 --> 49:37.525
I even got a photo of you wearing them as proof.

699
49:38.055 --> 49:40.895
But there is a lot of your stuff circulating on there.

700
49:40.955 --> 49:43.625
Wow, what kind of crazy lunatic...

701
49:43.695 --> 49:45.995
would post this on there like that?

702
49:46.065 --> 49:47.665
Oh, they need to be taught a serious lesson.

703
49:49.235 --> 49:51.605
(Juan Hospital)

704
49:52.635 --> 49:54.735
They absolutely cannot revise the script,

705
49:54.805 --> 49:56.405
so for now, the actress standing in for Na Ri...

706
49:56.475 --> 49:58.475
is going to film in her place today.

707
49:59.075 --> 50:01.715
Since she just lies there, her face will not be shown,

708
50:02.045 --> 50:03.985
so it is fine if an extra does it.

709
50:04.045 --> 50:05.585
Yes, you are here?

710
50:05.955 --> 50:06.985
Is something wrong?

711
50:07.385 --> 50:09.055
Well, the script says a simple ring,

712
50:09.125 --> 50:10.785
but the props team prepared a huge gemstone ring.

713
50:11.255 --> 50:12.895
Oh, your ring...

714
50:13.655 --> 50:16.095
Can we use that as a prop?

715
50:16.325 --> 50:18.995
No. This is the One Ring.

716
50:19.065 --> 50:21.295
So absolutely, absolutely not.

717
50:21.365 --> 50:22.765
Oh man, this props team...

718
50:23.135 --> 50:24.635
(Emergency Medical Center)

719
50:27.205 --> 50:28.235
What is wrong with him?

720
50:28.705 --> 50:30.005
They said he only slept for a few hours.

721
50:30.075 --> 50:31.745
That is how it is for extras.

722
50:31.805 --> 50:33.045
Should I wake him up?

723
50:33.115 --> 50:36.185
- No, I will just go somewhere else. - Okay.

724
50:36.485 --> 50:39.515
Our scene is set up in the VIP hospital room on the ninth floor.

725
50:39.585 --> 50:41.585
Prep is all done, and they said Song Na Ri's stand-in is there too.

726
50:42.955 --> 50:43.955
I will go wait there.

727
50:45.185 --> 50:46.955
Tae Bong, the elevator...

728
50:48.095 --> 50:49.095
Right.

729
51:05.175 --> 51:07.145
Oh, it is spacious.

730
51:20.655 --> 51:23.165
Excuse me, let's practice a bit.

731
51:27.695 --> 51:28.835
What?

732
51:29.505 --> 51:32.835
She is sleeping too. And in a very deep sleep at that.

733
51:34.405 --> 51:37.845
Oh well, sure, go ahead and sleep. The life of an extra is hard.

734
51:37.905 --> 51:39.615
Back then, I fell asleep as soon as my head hit the pillow too.

735
51:43.445 --> 51:45.445
The set looks realistic too.

736
51:47.585 --> 51:50.685
And you look exactly like a real unconscious patient.

737
51:52.495 --> 51:54.995
Okay, okay, you don't have to get up.

738
51:55.555 --> 51:57.695
You sleep, and I will rehearse.

739
52:09.175 --> 52:10.775
How did you pull off a scam with that brain?

740
52:13.675 --> 52:14.675
No.

741
52:15.145 --> 52:16.745
Because your brain is only capable of that much,

742
52:16.815 --> 52:18.415
you got caught by an idiot like me.

743
52:21.085 --> 52:22.625
Now, let's pretend I put the ring on you.

744
52:25.425 --> 52:26.655
You are in big trouble now.

745
52:30.065 --> 52:31.495
You can't go to another guy now.

746
52:36.135 --> 52:39.005
Gosh, man, the feeling is just not there.

747
52:56.325 --> 52:57.525
You are in big trouble now.

748
53:03.295 --> 53:04.765
You can't go to another guy now.

749
53:09.135 --> 53:10.605
You can't even smile at another guy.

750
53:21.915 --> 53:23.085
Don't leave me.

751
53:26.585 --> 53:27.585
Without you,

752
53:31.955 --> 53:33.295
I really can't go on.

753
53:36.895 --> 53:37.895
I love you.

754
53:46.075 --> 53:47.105
Darn it.

755
53:47.875 --> 53:48.905
Gosh.

756
53:49.505 --> 53:50.705
I am getting strangely emotional.

757
53:52.105 --> 53:53.775
You saw everything while sleeping, didn't you?

758
53:59.815 --> 54:00.815
Yes.

759
54:00.885 --> 54:03.555
Song Na Ri says she will arrive in four hours,

760
54:03.625 --> 54:05.055
and she insists on shooting this scene herself.

761
54:05.125 --> 54:07.955
Something about not being able to leave even one scene to a stand-in.

762
54:08.025 --> 54:09.225
She is so full of herself, seriously.

763
54:09.295 --> 54:10.825
Gosh, I will just push forward with it.

764
54:10.895 --> 54:12.165
I will tell them we don't have time.

765
54:12.865 --> 54:13.865
No.

766
54:14.535 --> 54:15.865
The lines are not rolling off my tongue either.

767
54:22.505 --> 54:23.875
That little thing...

768
54:24.445 --> 54:25.845
is really going to be an actor.

769
54:31.645 --> 54:34.315
Hey extra, your shoot is canceled for today too.

770
54:34.585 --> 54:37.855
But well, I have no intention of telling you.

771
54:37.925 --> 54:39.725
That is your punishment for sleeping earlier.

772
54:40.225 --> 54:42.765
I am leaving, so you just keep sleeping here.

773
54:43.195 --> 54:44.195
Good work.

774
56:04.445 --> 56:09.245
January 23, 8:05pm. The patient has passed away.

775
56:34.805 --> 56:35.905
Of all days, on her birthday...

776
56:37.705 --> 56:39.075
When will you be at the hospital, sir?

777
56:44.845 --> 56:46.015
Even if I go,

778
56:48.455 --> 56:49.755
will that child come back to life?

779
57:28.055 --> 57:29.055
Hey. Darn it.

780
57:55.315 --> 57:56.325
Grab him.

781
57:59.925 --> 58:02.655
Hey, grab him. I said hold him.

782
58:22.815 --> 58:23.815
I told you, didn't I?

783
58:27.715 --> 58:28.715
That I would always...

784
58:32.085 --> 58:33.325
protect you.

785
58:37.825 --> 58:41.265
They say we remember the first being we see after birth as our mother.

786
58:41.865 --> 58:43.835
This woman in front of my eyes right now,

787
58:44.165 --> 58:46.335
who has met me after being born again...

788
58:46.935 --> 58:48.335
How will she remember me?

789
58:55.845 --> 58:58.815
(Oh! My Guard)
